{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach object, if visible, move to object, grab if possible, check object, then perform specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToGetObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbable    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    />",
